# This repository is checked out on Windows, where git's core.autocrlf rewrites working-tree files
# to CRLF. Several tests compare a committed file byte for byte against text a generator produces
# (integrations/src/snippets.test.ts against buildScriptTag, readme.test.ts against the same), and
# the snippets are also copied verbatim into the platform zips. Both break the moment a checkout
# silently changes the line endings, so the working tree keeps LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
